      "content": "13.1 Jnanpith Awardees from Karnataka (Complete List)"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Karnataka has a rich literary heritage with a total of 8 Jnanpith Award recipients.",
        "The Karnataka Ratna is the highest civilian honour conferred by the Karnataka State Government.",
        "The Rajyotsava Award serves as Karnataka's second highest civilian honour, awarded annually.",
        "Several eminent personalities associated with Karnataka have been honored with the Bharat Ratna.",
        "Sahitya Akademi Awards recognize outstanding achievements and publications in Kannada literature."
